# MD5SUM - Make or verify an MD5 list

```text
MD5SUM [options] [filespec ...]
```

## Record digests

Give a filespec to display an MD5 digest for each match. /LOCAL writes
the list beside the selected files. /FILE= names a master list.

```text
B0:MD5SUM D0:*.COM /LOCAL=MD5SUM.LST
```

## Check a disk

```text
B0:MD5SUM /CHECK D0:
```

Run the check against the saved list after copying or restoring files.
If a digest differs, use [COMPARE](COMPARE.HLP) with the original copy
for a byte-level report.
